OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFor most it will be a dry day,
OL,6,Fwith hazy spells of sunshine.
OL,7,FCloudiest skies in the north, with a
OL,8,Fscattering of showers across Scotland.
OL,9,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine and
OL,10,Fstill locally hot across southern
OL,11,FEngland. Winds staying light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSunny spells ahead of dusk,
OL,14,Fthen cloud thickening overnight across
OL,15,Fthe northwest of the UK, with some
OL,16,Frain and drizzle. Skies clearest in
OL,17,Fthe south. A little fresher for most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
