OL,5,CSunday:FRather cloudy with showery
OL,6,Flight rain across Scotland and
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland. Dry elsewhere, with
OL,8,Fwarm spells of hazy sunshine. Feeling
OL,9,Fpleasant for many, with light winds.
